香醇濃郁雞骨白湯，真的越喝越喜歡！麵條軟硬適中很剛好🤤\n\n🍤鮮蝦雲吞蝦湯拉麵 —\n期間嚐鮮價只要$180！\n這碗比較特別還有使用蝦頭湯融入雞白湯，喝起來濃郁卻不膩😳可以吃到一整隻蝦的雲吞＋舒肥雞叉燒整個超澎湃！\n\n🍥 味噌拉麵 —\n多了味增整體風味更多層次，上面的叉燒經過炙燒真的超讚，這碗我自己也很推推！\n\n其中我要說店面風格也好厲害，以日式屋台街邊攤車為亮點🇯🇵真的會讓人一秒到日本的感覺，最重要的是價格整體很平價✨\n\n除了高度還原日本傳統好味道，又有結合台灣在地天然食材🍖在台灣就能輕鬆體驗道地的日本拉麵文化，愛吃拉麵的朋友千萬別錯過囉🍜",null,[0,142]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/15861239741813641236/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFzZEZGVlRsRmtWazUzVFhwbk5VMXJSakZqV0doT1lUSmtUMHhXUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/15861239741813641236/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFzZEZGVlRsRmtWazUzVFhwbk5VMXJSakZqV0doT1lUSmtUMHhXUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/15861239741813641236/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFzZEZGVlRsRmtWazUzVFhwbk5VMXJSakZqV0doT1lUSmtUMHhXUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/15861239741813641236/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFzZEZGVlRsRmtWazUzVFhwbk5VMXJSakZqV0doT1lUSmtUMHhXUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/15861239741813641236/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFzZEZGVlRsRmtWazUzVFhwbk5VMXJSakZqV0doT1lUSmtUMHhXUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/15861239741813641236/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFzZEZGVlRsRmtWazUzVFhwbk5VMXJSakZqV0doT1lUSmtUMHhXUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,1421,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21sdFFVTlFkVk53TXpnNU1rRjFjWGhOYTJkT0xWRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xe79a873cf78d84d1!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmltQUNQdVNwMzg5MkF1cXhNa2dOLVE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21sdFFVTlFkVk53TXpnNU1rRjFjWGhOYTJkT0xWRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21sdFFVTlFkVk53TXpnNU1rRjFjWGhOYTJkT0xWRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21